aterials-review\",\"order\":4,\"label\":\"材料审查\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"cell:label:recruitment:materials-review\",\"row_id\":\"row:recruitment:materials-review\",\"column_id\":\"col:field\",\"text\":\"材料审查\",\"style_role\":\"body\"},{\"cell_id\":\"recruitment:materials-review\",\"row_id\":\"row:recruitment:materials-review\",\"column_id\":\"col:value\",\"text\":\"招募材料及其他受试者相关文件须获得伦理委员会批准后方可使用；方案和知情同意书采用版本号和日期控制；研究中心仅使用伦理委员会批准的最新版本。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:recruitment:contacts\",\"order\":5,\"label\":\"联系措施\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"cell:label:recruitment:contacts\",\"row_id\":\"row:recruitment:contacts\",\"column_id\":\"col:field\",\"text\":\"联系措施\",\"style_role\":\"body\"},{\"cell_id\":\"recruitment:contacts\",\"row_id\":\"row:recruitment:contacts\",\"column_id\":\"col:value\",\"text\":\"研究中心公开联系电话；仅使用伦理批准的招募材料。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:recruitment:visits\",\"order\":6,\"label\":\"访视措施\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"cell:label:recruitment:visits\",\"row_id\":\"row:recruitment:visits\",\"column_id\":\"col:field\",\"text\":\"访视措施\",\"style_role\":\"body\"},{\"cell_id\":\"recruitment:visits\",\"row_id\":\"row:recruitment:visits\",\"column_id\":\"col:value\",\"text\":\"筛选期从签署知情同意书开始，完成入排标准确认、基线评估和背景治疗稳定性确认；确认符合全部入排标准并完成随机化后，第1天开始首次给药。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:retention:strategy\",\"order\":7,\"label\":\"保留策略\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"cell:label:retention:strategy\",\"row_id\":\"row:retention:strategy\",\"column_id\":\"col:field\",\"text\":\"保留策略\",\"style_role\":\"body\"},{\"cell_id\":\"retention:strategy\",\"row_id\":\"row:retention:strategy\",\"column_id\":\"col:value\",\"text\":\"通过方案规定的访视窗、安全性随访、不良事件和合并用药记录、依从性记录、失访联系程序和退出管理提高保留；受试者停用研究干预但未撤回知情同意时，继续按方案收集安全性和疗效随访数据；撤回知情同意后不再收集新数据，除非法规要求或受试者另行同意，已收集数据按预定义分析计划使用；第24周访视窗口及随访到期后，通过电话、短信或邮件、信件等经批准的联系方式至少进行3次联系尝试，尽量覆盖不同日期和时段；仅使用受试者授权联系方式。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]},{\"row_id\":\"row:retention:follow-up\",\"order\":8,\"label\":\"随访与失访处理\",\"cells\":[{\"cell_id\":\"cell:label:retention:follow-up\",\"row_id\":\"row:retention:follow-up\",\"column_id\":\"col:field\",\"text\":\"随访与失访处理\",\"style_role\":\"body\"},{\"cell_id\":\"retention:follow-up\",\"row_id\":\"row:retention:follow-up\",\"column_id\":\"col:value\",\"text\":\"仅停用研究干预者继续随访至第24周；因不良事件停药者随访至事件稳定或恢复，并按医学监查要求完成安全性随访；撤回知情同意者不进行进一步研究随访；安全性随访按治疗期访视及末次给药后第24周评估进行；如发生不良事件，随访至事件消退或稳定；经至少3次合理联系尝试仍无法联系且无明确撤回同意者，由研究者审核分类为失访；后续恢复联系时按方案评估是否继续随访。\",\"style_role\":\"body\",\"provenance_lineage\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]}]}},{\"block_id\":\"block:v2_n_5_5:p5\",\"kind\":\"paragraph\",\"text\":\"本研究已确认适用参与者补偿安排。试验相关损害由申办方依法承担赔偿责任并提供相应补偿；申办方为本试验购买临床试验责任保险；补偿与损害处理条款以临床试验协议为准。研究者立即处置并记录试验相关损害；申办方承担治疗费用并依法补偿。补偿与损害处理的负责联系人为申办方医学监察员及药物安全负责人（联系方式见中心启动资料）。\",\"evidence_refs\":[],\"source_locator\":\"\"}]}","receipt":{"idempotency_key":"chapter-draft.generate.v1","input_artifacts":[{"ref":"chapter-intake","sha256":"e9183db00aaaee18724c2b885f74db90a06590cff98629fbdf4fd7940dff59f3"}],"logical_call_id":"call:chapter-draft:6735762978c5b7afbc276d4cdcd9d200958222952621c3cfdc86ed4c11f67833:chapter-generate","node_execution_contract_id":"nec:chapter-draft:6735762978c5b7afbc276d4cdcd9d200958222952621c3cfdc86ed4c11f67833:chapter-generate","observed_model":"deepseek-flash","observed_provider":"deepseek","output_schema_ref":"https://protocol-v3.local/schemas/ordered-chapter-draft-candidate.v1.json","output_sha256":"d056b932fbbe01efc6db383a9745b928346c3fc9debb1a4e46924cdc8538d135","prompt_sha256":"47dd66c834319411962b91127cd952207cccdab4dee7068a9ab81409e5aefa1e","provider_session_id":"d21c1280-22d6-4de6-863e-4c0ec0456b3d","requested_reasoning_effort":"max"},"schema":"model_response.v1"}